  "ui_html": "<div aria-modal=\"true\" class=\"modal fade show\" id=\"kt_modal_email_preview\" role=\"dialog\" style=\"display: block;\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-xl\">\n<div class=\"modal-content\">\n<div class=\"modal-header\">\n<div class=\"d-flex flex-column\">\n<h2 class=\"fw-bold mb-1\" id=\"emailPreviewCampaignName\">Campaign - Cogent Free Users \\u002D Offer</h2>\n<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-3\">\n<span class=\"text-muted fs-7\">\n<i class=\"ki-duotone ki-abstract-26 fs-7 me-1\"><span class=\"path1\"></span><span class=\"path2\"></span></i>\n                                Subject: <span class=\"fw-semibold text-gray-700\" id=\"emailPreviewSubject\">We just added 10 credits to your Cogent account</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"text-muted fs-7\">\u00b7</span>\n<span class=\"text-muted fs-7\">\n<i class=\"ki-duotone ki-calendar fs-7 me-1\"><span class=\"path1\"></span><span class=\"path2\"></span></i>\n                                Sent: <span class=\"fw-semibold text-gray-700\" id=\"emailPreviewSentAt\">Apr 27, 2026 at 12:57</span>\n</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"btn btn-icon btn-sm btn-active-icon-primary ms-auto\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\">\n<i class=\"ki-duotone ki-cross fs-1\"><span class=\"path1\"></span><span class=\"path2\"></span></i>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"modal-body p-0\">\n<!-- Toolbar -->\n<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center px-7 py-3 border-bottom border-gray-200 bg-light\">\n<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-2\">\n<span class=\"badge badge-light-primary fs-8 px-3 py-2\">\n<i class=\"ki-duotone ki-sms fs-7 me-1\"><span class=\"path1\"></span><span class=\"path2\"></span></i>\n                                To: sidharth@likwid.co.in\n                            </span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ms-auto d-flex gap-2\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-light-primary\" id=\"emailPreviewToggle\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"ki-duotone ki-code fs-5\"><span class=\"path1\"></span><span class=\"path2\"></span><span class=\"path3\"></span><span class=\"path4\"></span></i> View Source</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Rendered HTML view -->\n<div id=\"emailPreviewRendered\" style=\"min-height:400px; max-height:600px; overflow-y:auto;\">\n<!-- \u2705 FIX 1: Added \"allow-scripts\" to sandbox -->\n<!-- OLD: sandbox=\"allow-same-origin\" -->\n<!-- Without allow-scripts, the browser blocks ANY script inside the iframe,\n                             including inline <style> tags being applied, causing the email to render\n                             unstyled and throwing \"Blocked script execution\" in the console. -->\n<iframe id=\"emailPreviewIframe\" sandbox=\"allow-same-origin allow-scripts\" srcdoc='&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html&gt;\n&lt;head&gt;\n&lt;meta charset=\"utf-8\"&gt;\n&lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;\n&lt;style&gt;\n  body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; background-color: #f4f4f4; }\n  .email-container { background-color: #ffffff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; }\n  .content-section { margin: 20px 0; word-break: break-word; }\n  a { color: #007bff; }\n&lt;/style&gt;\n&lt;/head&gt;\n&lt;body&gt;\n  &lt;div class=\"email-container\"&gt;\n    &lt;div style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:30px;\"&gt;\n                         &lt;img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/likwid\\u002Dmedia/email_templates/logos/Logo_Typography_1.png?X\\u002DGoog\\u002DAlgorithm\\u003DGOOG4\\u002DRSA\\u002DSHA256\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DCredential\\u003Dlikwid\\u002Dapp\\u002Dalpha%40appspot.gserviceaccount.com%2F20260427%2Fauto%2Fstorage%2Fgoog4_request\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DDate\\u003D20260427T125727Z\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DExpires\\u003D86400\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DSignedHeaders\\u003Dhost\\u0026X\\u002DGoog\\u002DSignature\\\" alt=\"Logo\" style=\"max-width:200px; height:auto;\" /&gt;\n                       &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=\"content-section\"&gt;We\\u0027ve upgraded every free account on Cogent. More room to build, explore, and create.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Previously, free accounts started with 5 credits. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We heard the feedback: that wasn\\u0027t enough to properly explore what Cogent can do. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;So we fixed it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Here\\u0027s what 10 credits gets you:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Generate your website homepage&lt;br&gt;1. Add new pages \u2014 landing pages, about, services, contact&lt;br&gt;2. Edit and refine until it looks exactly right&lt;br&gt;3. All without spending a rupee&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your credits are already in your account. No action needed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you\\u0027ve been meaning to try it, now\\u0027s the time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\u2014 Team Cogent&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:30px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid #eee;\"&gt;\n                         &lt;a href=\"https://cogent.likwid.ai/\" style=\"display:inline-block; background-color:#007bff; color:#fff; padding:12px 30px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:5px; font-weight:bold;\"&gt;Open Cogent&lt;/a&gt;\n                       &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;' style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 400px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; display: block; height: 580px;\">\n</iframe>\n</div>\n<!-- Raw source view (hidden by default) -->\n<div id=\"emailPreviewSource\" style=\"display:none; min-height:400px; max-height:600px; overflow-y:auto;\">\n<pre class=\"p-7 m-0 fs-7 text-gray-700\" id=\"emailPreviewSourceText\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap; word-break:break-all; background:#f8f9fa;\">We\\u0027ve upgraded every free account on Cogent. More room to build, explore, and create.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000APreviously, free accounts started with 5 credits. \\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AWe heard the feedback: that wasn\\u0027t enough to properly explore what Cogent can do. \\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000ASo we fixed it.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AHere\\u0027s what 10 credits gets you:\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AGenerate your website homepage\\u000D\\u000A1. Add new pages \u2014 landing pages, about, services, contact\\u000D\\u000A2. Edit and refine until it looks exactly right\\u000D\\u000A3. All without spending a rupee\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AYour credits are already in your account. No action needed.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000AIf you\\u0027ve been meaning to try it, now\\u0027s the time.\\u000D\\u000A\\u000D\\u000A\u2014 Team Cogent</pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"modal-footer border-top border-gray-200 py-4\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-light\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" type=\"button\">Close</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
